{% extends '../../base.njk' %}
{% block main %}

{#
  Retired September 2026.

  This page uploaded a video to delivery-kid, which sent it to Coconut.co for
  transcoding and pinned the result. Coconut has been removed: encoding now
  happens on delivery-kid itself, in royalty-free AV1 and Opus, and the
  endpoints this page called (/transcode-coconut and /job/<id>) no longer
  exist. See cryptograss/maybelle-config#126.

  The page is kept as a signpost rather than deleted so the URL does not 404
  for anyone who bookmarked it. Publishing now happens on PickiPedia, which
  does the whole job: a draft page you can watch, the encode, the IPFS pin,
  a Release page and a torrent.
#}

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-1"></div>
    <div class="col-md-10 text-post">
        <h1 class="text-center pixel-font">Video Upload</h1>
        <p class="text-center text-muted">This tool has moved to PickiPedia</p>

        <div class="row mt-4">
            <div class="col-md-8 offset-md-2">
                <div class="card semi-transparent-bg mb-4">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <p>
                            Video publishing now happens at
                            <a href="https://pickipedia.xyz/wiki/Special:DeliverVideo">Special:DeliverVideo</a>
                            on PickiPedia, which handles the whole job: a draft page you can
                            watch while it works, the encode, the IPFS pin, a Release page and
                            a torrent.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            Video is encoded on our own server now, into
                            <strong>AV1 and Opus</strong> — both royalty-free and DRM-free — at
                            four sizes, including an audio-only version for slow connections.
                            The cloud transcoding service this page relied on has been retired.
                        </p>
                        <p class="mb-0">
                            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://pickipedia.xyz/wiki/Special:DeliverVideo">Publish a video</a>
                            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://pickipedia.xyz/wiki/Cryptograss:Video_encoding_pipeline">How the pipeline works</a>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-1"></div>
</div>

{% endblock %}
